9Is💭 this💡 blessing🎁 only☝️ for➡️ circumcised✂️ people👥, or🔀 also➕ for➡️ the👥 uncircumcised🌱? We🫂 say🗣️ Abraham’s👴 faith🙏 was✅ counted🧮 as➡️ righteousness⚖️.
