11Then🔜 Abraham👴 received🎁 circumcision✂️ as➡️ a💛 sign🔖, a💛 seal🔒 that💡 God🙌 had✅ already⏮️ counted🧮 his👤 faith🙏 as➡️ righteousness⚖️ while⏱️ he👴 was🚫 uncircumcised🌱. That💡 made✅ him👴 father👨 of➡️ everyone👥 who✅ believes🙏, even💯 if🤔 they👥 aren’t🚫 circumcised✂️—so➡️ they👥 too💯 can✅ be✅ counted🧮 right⚖️ with➡️ God🙌.
12He👴 is✅ also➕ father👨 of➡️ the✂️ circumcised✂️ who✅ don’t🚫 just☝️ have✅ the🪡 sign🔖, but💡 also➕ follow🚶 the👣 faith🙏 Abraham👴 had✅ before⏮️ circumcision✂️—unu🫵, walk🚶 that👣 same💯 faith🙏.
13God’s🙌 promise🎁 that✅ Abraham👴 would✅ inherit🏡 the🌍 world🌎 didn’t🚫 come🚶 through➡️ law📜, but💡 through➡️ righteousness⚖️ by➡️ faith🙏.
