17As📜 Scripture📜 says🗣️, “I🙋 have✅ made✅ you🫵 father👨 of➡️ many💯 nations🌍”—ọtụtụ🌍. Abraham👴 believed🙏 God🙌, who✅ gives🎁 life🌱 to➡️ the💀 dead💀 and🔊 calls📣 into➡️ existence🌍 what💭 didn’t🚫 exist🫥.
