19Abraham’s👴 faith🙏 didn’t🚫 collapse💥. He👴 faced👀 the💡 fact📊 that✅ his👤 body💪 was✅ as💯 good💯 as✅ dead💀—he👴 was✅ about📍 a💯 hundred💯 years📅 old👴—and🔗 Sarah’s👵 womb👶 was✅ also➕ beyond🚫 childbearing👶.
