21Abraham👴 became✅ fully💯 convinced🙏 that💡 God🙌 had✅ the💪 power⚡ to➡️ do🎬 exactly✅ what📣 he👑 promised🤝.
22That’s💡 why🤔 God🙌 counted🧮 Abraham’s👴 faith🙏 as➡️ righteousness⚖️.
23That📜 record✍️ wasn’t🚫 written✍️ only☝️ for➡️ Abraham👴, to➡️ say🗣️ God🙌 counted🧮 faith🙏 as➡️ righteousness⚖️ for➡️ him👴.
